#: review-bp-grps.php
#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Wbcom Designs - BuddyPress Group Reviews"
msgstr "Wbcom Designs - BuddyPress Group Reviews"

#: review-bp-grps.php
#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wbcomdesigns.com/contact/"
msgstr "https://wbcomdesigns.com/contact/"

#: review-bp-grps.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"This plugin allows BuddyPress Members to give reviews to BuddyPress groups "
"on the site. The review form allows users to give text reviews and even "
"rate the group based on multiple criteria."
msgstr ""
"Ce plugin permet aux membres de BuddyPress de laisser des avis sur les "
"groupes BuddyPress du site. Le formulaire d'avis permet aux utilisateurs de "
"laisser des avis textuels et même d'évaluer le groupe selon plusieurs "
"critères."

