#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:17
msgid "About BuddyPress Group Reviews"
msgstr "À propos de BuddyPress Group Reviews"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:21
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Group Reviews lets members add reviews for groups and rate them "
"across multiple criteria. Submitted reviews appear in the group's \"Manage "
"Reviews\" section, where admins approve or deny them. Approved reviews show "
"in the group's \"Reviews\" tab. Add as many rating criteria as you need."
msgstr ""
"BuddyPress Group Reviews permet aux membres d'ajouter des avis sur les "
"groupes et de les évaluer selon plusieurs critères. Les avis soumis "
"apparaissent dans la section « Gérer les avis » du groupe, où les "
"administrateurs les approuvent ou les refusent. Les avis approuvés "
"s'affichent dans l'onglet « Avis » du groupe. Ajoute autant de critères "
"d'évaluation que tu en as besoin."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:28
msgid "Help &amp; Support Resources"
msgstr "Ressources d'aide et de support"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:29
msgid ""
"If you need assistance, here are some helpful resources. Our documentation "
"is a great place to start, and our support team is available if you require "
"further help."
msgstr ""
"Si tu as besoin d'aide, voici quelques ressources utiles. Notre "
"documentation est un excellent point de départ, et notre équipe "
"d'assistance est disponible si tu as besoin d'aide supplémentaire."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:35
msgid ""
"Explore our detailed guide to understand all the features and how to make "
"the most of them."
msgstr ""
"Explore notre guide détaillé pour comprendre toutes les fonctionnalités et "
"en tirer le meilleur parti."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:36
msgid "Read Documentation"
msgstr "Lire la documentation"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:39
msgid "Support Center"
msgstr "Centre d'assistance"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:40
msgid ""
"Our support team is here to assist you with any questions or issues. "
"Contact us anytime through our support center."
msgstr ""
"Notre équipe d'assistance est là pour t'aider avec toute question ou "
"problème. Contacte-nous à tout moment via notre centre d'assistance."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:41
msgid "Get Support"
msgstr "Obtenir de l'aide"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:44
msgid "Share Your Feedback"
msgstr "Partage ton avis"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:45
msgid ""
"We'd love to hear about your experience with the plugin. Your feedback "
"helps us improve future updates."
msgstr ""
"Nous aimerions connaître ton expérience avec le plugin. Tes commentaires "
"nous aident à améliorer les futures mises à jour."

